---
title: "invest (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: caller invests capital
    q_check_paused --> q_check_stage: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_check_stage --> q_check_prefund: block.timestamp in prefund or active sale period
    q_check_stage --> q_revert_stage: outside investment windows
    q_check_prefund --> q_verify_sig: isPrefund = (block.timestamp >= prefundStartTime AND block.timestamp < prefundEndTime)
    q_check_prefund --> q_check_active: not in prefund period
    q_check_active --> q_verify_sig: block.timestamp >= startTime AND block.timestamp < endTime
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_amount: signature valid from authorized signer
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid signature
    q_check_amount --> q_update_position: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_check_amount --> q_revert_amount: amount below minimum
    q_update_position --> q_transfer: position.investedCapital += amount, totalInvestedCapital += amount
    q_transfer --> q_emit: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_transfer --> q_revert_transfer: transfer failed
    q_emit --> [*]: emit Invested(investor, amount, isPrefund)
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert Paused
    q_revert_stage --> [*]: revert InvalidStage
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_revert_amount --> [*]: revert BelowMinimum
    q_revert_transfer --> [*]: revert TransferFailed

    note right of q_verify_sig
        INV-001: Signature must be from authorized Legion signer
        INV-002: Each signature can only be used once (replay protection)
    end note

    note right of q_update_position
        INV-003: totalInvestedCapital always equals sum of all position.investedCapital
        INV-004: Investor capital held in contract until refund, withdrawal, or distribution
    end note
